IAPWS_IF97 (src/iapws_if97/)
----------------------------

The `iapws_if97` module is a Rust translation of `IAPWS_IF97.m` by Mark
Mikofski — 27 water/steam property functions implementing the IAPWS Industrial
Formulation 1997, together with IAPWS-IF97-S01, -S03rev, -S04, -S05, the 2008
Revised Advisory Note No. 3 on thermodynamic derivatives, the 2008 viscosity
release, and the 2008 revised release of the 1985 thermal-conductivity
formulation.

  Upstream project:  IAPWS_IF97
  Upstream source:   https://github.com/mikofski/IAPWS_IF97
  Source file:       IAPWS_IF97.m
  Version:           no tagged release; taken as vendored into Than Yan Ren's
                     `main_exec_diff3d_standalone` snapshot
  Copyright:         Copyright (c) 2013, Mark Mikofski
  Licence:           BSD-2-Clause

Note on the author's name: the copy of `IAPWS_IF97.m` vendored into the BEDOK
snapshot renders the copyright line as "Mark Mifofski". The upstream repository
and its licence file both give "Mark Mikofski", which is used here as the
correct spelling.

BSD-2-Clause is compatible with GPL-3.0, so the combined work is distributed
under GPL-3.0-only while these terms continue to govern the translated
material.

